## Golden: escribir un elemento de una lista compartida clona primero (COW).
##
## `set xs at i is v` usa `pengu_cow_list_at_mut`; la lectura sigue usando
## `pengu_list_at`.
import std.spark

weave main into int:
    var a as vector of int is [1, 2, 3]
    var b as vector of int is a
    set b at 0 is 9
    calling spark.println with "{a at 0} {b at 0}"
    banish a
    banish b
    return 0
